": "0", "image": "engenn5le12ob02re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: So, you ran into his ex-girlfriend ... what happened next?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: She was the waitress!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh no!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: While we were ordering, she kept giving Marco flirty looks. He was drinking like a fish, too!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le12ob02re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ugh, that's terrible! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Mmhmm...when the bill came, he was looking at me like I had to pay for it.  I was completely speechless.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What a cheapskate!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's too bad, because the food was exquisite. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What a waste!", "id": 2, "time": "14000", "image": "engenn5le12ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: He became really pushy while we were leaving the restaurant and tried to get his ex's attention.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What was he doing?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: He was yelling and acting really obnoxious.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I can't believe it! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Then his ex-girlfriend came out and started yelling at him, calling him all sorts of names.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What happened next?", "id": 3, "time": "29500", "image": "engenn5le12ob02re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}